**Quick — duration clarification**

Glossary should read:  
**Quick**  
You may change positions without spending your action — a free move in addition to your normal action that turn, not a replacement for it. Quick fades at the end of your turn whether you used the free move or not.

Current text can be read as “keep Quick indefinitely until you spend the free move.” That is not the intent. It is a same-turn grant only.